---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ
    participant DB as Vigilo DB
    participant WASM as WASM Runtime

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo worker start
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build evaluator loader and start worker service
    Vigilo->>Queue: Open worker consumer stream
    Queue-->>Vigilo: Delivery stream

    loop Until shutdown or service failure
        alt Shutdown signal received
            User->>Vigilo: Shutdown signal
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Cancel consumer loop and wait for service stop
            Vigilo-->>User: Success response
        else Delivery received
            Queue-->>Vigilo: Chunk-ready message
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Deserialize message payload
            Vigilo->>DB: Claim chunk lease
            DB-->>Vigilo: Claimed chunk or no claim

            alt Chunk claimed
                Vigilo->>DB: Load run context and case batch
                DB-->>Vigilo: Profile, evaluator catalog, and cases
                Vigilo->>WASM: Warm evaluator components
                WASM-->>Vigilo: Warmup result
                Vigilo->>WASM: Execute case batch evaluators
                WASM-->>Vigilo: Evaluation outputs
                Vigilo->>DB: Persist execution results and complete chunk
                DB-->>Vigilo: Processing outcome
                Vigilo->>Queue: Acknowledge message
            else Invalid payload or unclaimable chunk
                Vigilo->>Queue: Acknowledge message
            else Recoverable processing failure
                Vigilo->>DB: Release chunk lease
                Vigilo->>Queue: Requeue or acknowledge message
            end
        else Consumer stream closed
            Vigilo->>Queue: Reopen worker consumer stream
        else Delivery or service fails
            Vigilo-->>User: Service error
        end
    end
    deactivate Vigilo
